Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=1}========================CHAPTERS AND OPENINGS=====================
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{=2}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 50,0:03:02.11,0:03:04.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TOWNSPERSON A]\NCome and get your freshwater clams!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:05.77,0:03:07.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TOWNSPERSON B]\NMove outta my way!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:10.90,0:03:12.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TOWNSPERSON C]\NCome one, come all, don't be shy!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:12.94,0:03:15.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our famous Flower Udon\Nis waiting for you!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:34.13,0:03:35.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NHmm?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:50.35,0:03:51.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CARPENTER A]\NWe're short-handed here.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:51.73,0:03:53.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Could you lend me some help?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:54.27,0:03:56.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CARPENTER B]\NHey! Carry the other end!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:56.79,0:04:00.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bah! Hey you, Greenhorn!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:00.46,0:04:02.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the new guy!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:02.13,0:04:03.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell me, is this your work up here?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:03.88,0:04:05.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, answer me, boy!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:06.10,0:04:08.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You bet! Is there a problem?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:09.68,0:04:11.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Or do you just wanna shout?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:11.73,0:04:15.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now listen up! You fool!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:15.53,0:04:17.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your woodwork's utterly perfect!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:18.49,0:04:21.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nice job! You damn fool!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:23.58,0:04:26.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course, it's perfect! Because I...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:26.62,0:04:28.50,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,You must maintain your role!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:28.50,0:04:30.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:04:33.27,0:04:36.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gotcha. I'm happy to hear it then.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:36.90,0:04:38.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:39.99,0:04:41.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That guy's an asshole!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:46.33,0:04:47.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ribbits]
Dialogue: 50,0:04:47.37,0:04:48.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NStep right up, folks!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:48.83,0:04:51.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C'mon! Gather 'round everyone!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:52.03,0:04:55.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NHere's an ordinary sheet of paper,\Nno gimmicks or setup here!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:55.95,0:04:57.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One sheet becomes two!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:57.83,0:04:59.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Two sheets become four!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:59.58,0:05:01.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But it doesn't end there, folks!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:01.08,0:05:05.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Four sheets become eight!\NEight to 16, and then 32 to 64!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:05.38,0:05:07.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you following me?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:09.51,0:05:11.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And just like the cherry blossom petals
Dialogue: 50,0:05:12.59,0:05:16.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,or snow fall at Wano's dusk,\Nyou too can make a flurry of paper,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:16.89,0:05:18.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,with little to no effort!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:28.16,0:05:29.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take witness!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:29.74,0:05:33.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I shall now demonstrate how\Nrazor-sharp this sword truly is!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:33.08,0:05:35.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha! Watch as I graze my skin!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:37.12,0:05:39.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Behold! A laceration!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:39.00,0:05:40.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[townspeople gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:05:40.50,0:05:43.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[townspeople murmuring]
Dialogue: 50,0:05:45.51,0:05:47.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now if I may direct\Nyour attention here!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:47.89,0:05:51.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What I'm holding in\Nmy palm is toad oil!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:52.19,0:05:56.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just apply a dab and watch\Nwhat it does to my wound.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:58.95,0:06:00.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP]\NVoila!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:01.28,0:06:03.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look! You see that?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:03.95,0:06:05.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A mere touch patches it up!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:06.33,0:06:08.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's all healed! And no bleeding!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:09.08,0:06:12.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This special toad oil\Nhails from the East Blue!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:12.23,0:06:14.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, do I have any takers?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:14.27,0:06:15.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TOWNSPERSON O]\NI'll take some!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:15.69,0:06:17.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wise folks, if I do say so!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:19.02,0:06:22.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now! Let's make one line\Nand don't shove!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:29.01,0:06:34.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Umi laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:06:34.10,0:06:35.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[UMI]\NOoh, irresistible!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:35.80,0:06:40.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes! Yes, that's the stuff right there!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.72,0:06:43.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Raise your arm a bit more!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:43.68,0:06:46.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And don't forget to\Nkeep those hips low!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:48.31,0:06:49.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:49.85,0:06:54.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[UMI]\NWhat you're hoping to achieve is nigh on\Nimpossible, so you need to push yourself!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:55.25,0:06:59.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not just any old gal receives a summons\Nto the shogun's chamber, let alone in
Dialogue: 50,0:06:59.64,0:07:01.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,such a short amount of time!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:01.51,0:07:04.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:04.02,0:07:07.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh, oh, oh! That's it!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:07.39,0:07:10.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Keep it up, baby! Yeah!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:13.65,0:07:14.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:29.64,0:07:32.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Zoro sighs]\NThat's some good saké.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:39.69,0:07:41.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO]\NI'll come back soon.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:41.03,0:07:42.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TOWNSPERSON Q]\NThank you for your business!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:50.29,0:07:52.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, look at that. Beautiful.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:53.17,0:07:55.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I should buy another round\Nand find a spot to moongaze.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:25.32,0:08:26.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The smell of blood?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:27.85,0:08:29.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's the rush?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:31.25,0:08:33.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're smelling pretty good there, bud.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:33.79,0:08:35.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that blood-scented perfume on you?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:36.38,0:08:37.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where'd ya pick that up?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:54.42,0:08:57.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're under arrest!\NSo stay right there!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:57.54,0:08:59.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[POLICE B]\NYou're the murderer!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:59.13,0:09:00.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[POLICE C]\NDon't resist!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:00.17,0:09:01.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[POLICE N]\NI wasn't.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:01.25,0:09:03.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[POLICE]\NWe'll be taking you in, slasher!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:03.25,0:09:05.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't move! Surrender!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:05.05,0:09:07.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's over. Drop the swords!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:09.93,0:09:12.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Since apparently I'm in some trouble,
Dialogue: 50,0:09:12.55,0:09:16.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll have to defend myself.\NOkay, let's do this!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.22,0:09:18.18,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,You must maintain your role!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:20.02,0:09:23.52,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,[KIN'EMON]\NListen, closely.\NYou are in the Land of Wano.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:24.11,0:09:25.57,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,We have a Shogun.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:25.99,0:09:27.53,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Remember his name.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:27.53,0:09:29.28,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Kurozumi Orochi!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:30.28,0:09:33.41,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Do keep in mind that any\Nofficials who do his bidding
Dialogue: 50,0:09:33.41,0:09:36.62,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,all have ties to\Nthe Emperor Kaido, himself!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:36.62,0:09:38.58,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Thus, these men are rogues!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:38.58,0:09:40.17,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Arrogant and corrupt.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:40.86,0:09:45.03,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,That's why, if you harm them,\NKaido will be the first to hear of it!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:45.66,0:09:48.37,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,We must not allow our\Nexistence to be known
Dialogue: 50,0:09:48.37,0:09:51.79,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,until our allies can\Nassemble with us once more.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:51.79,0:09:54.11,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Only then can preparations begin.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:54.11,0:09:55.86,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,It is essential that you blend in
Dialogue: 50,0:09:56.81,0:09:58.69,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,seamlessly with the locals.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:58.69,0:10:01.82,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll live quietly and\Ngo about your business.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:01.82,0:10:03.07,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,It is your duty!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:03.07,0:10:05.82,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Keep the peace! Am I clear?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:08.91,0:10:10.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guess I got no choice.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:10.87,0:10:13.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,On my honor. I surrender.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:14.16,0:10:15.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[POLICE D]\NGo! Grab him!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:15.75,0:10:18.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[police yell]
Dialogue: 50,0:10:24.93,0:10:29.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TOWNSPERSON T]\NThe menacing scourge who was\Nterrorizing our town is now in custody!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:29.10,0:10:32.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our brave magistrate has finally\Napprehended that scoundrel!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:33.40,0:10:36.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As punishment, he's being\Nsentenced to seppuku!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:36.65,0:10:39.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can read about the rest of\Nthe details right in here!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:39.61,0:10:40.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TOWNSPERSON F]\NGood riddance!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:40.90,0:10:44.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's the man that\Nmurdered my poor husband!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:44.28,0:10:45.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a relief!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:45.74,0:10:50.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I was worried this place would never be\Nsafe again after the three recent slashings!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:53.54,0:10:57.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Scuse me! You mind if\NI get one of those?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:57.00,0:10:58.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TOWNSPERSON T]\NSure! Here ya go!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:11.01,0:11:13.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TSUJIGIRO]\NSo your name is Zorojuro, is it?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:15.10,0:11:19.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your carnage has stricken fear\Ninto the hearts of our populace.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:20.06,0:11:25.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you do the honorable thing and commit\Nseppuku, our town shall be peaceful again.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:26.48,0:11:29.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, look at that! How funny.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:30.07,0:11:33.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Apparently, you're a\Ngrave-robber as well?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:33.95,0:11:38.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Twenty-three years ago,\Namidst a pirate upheaval,
Dialogue: 50,0:11:38.58,0:11:41.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the whereabouts of\Na legendary blade and
Dialogue: 50,0:11:41.04,0:11:44.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the corpse of its owner,\NRyuma, went missing.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:44.17,0:11:47.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TSUJIGIRO]\NThe name of his famed blade was Shusui.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:47.96,0:11:52.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Legend has it that Ryuma chopped the head\Noff a giant dragon with this sword.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.47,0:11:58.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And now I hold it\Nin my hands. Incredible.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:58.81,0:12:02.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just how old are you? I'm curious.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:02.77,0:12:06.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That infamous grave-robbery\Ntook place over two decades ago.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:06.13,0:12:08.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You seem a bit young to have done that.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:09.96,0:12:12.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you steal it from the thief?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:15.20,0:12:19.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter.\NI possess the sword now.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:19.00,0:12:21.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And what a fine treasure it is!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:25.12,0:12:26.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:26.54,0:12:30.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SAMURAI GUARD A]\NSir! The time is upon us,\NZorojuro, are you ready?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:34.51,0:12:38.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? What gives?\NThis blade's got no hilt.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:39.33,0:12:40.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:42.67,0:12:44.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your mightiness.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:44.34,0:12:47.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no need for one as it's\Nnot a weapon forged for battle.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:47.84,0:12:50.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The knife's short and lacks a handle.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:50.34,0:12:52.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's on purpose, you imbecile!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:53.35,0:12:56.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you making jest of the\Nsituation in your final moments?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:56.81,0:12:58.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you have any pride as a samurai,
Dialogue: 50,0:12:58.94,0:13:02.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,admit your guilt and make\Namends with your death.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:02.52,0:13:05.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure you don't\Nsuffer in your passing.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:06.44,0:13:08.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It is my duty!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:10.61,0:13:12.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Tsujigiro chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:13:28.74,0:13:31.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In that case, farewell.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:34.37,0:13:36.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TSUJIGIRO]\NDon't cry like a baby.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:37.50,0:13:41.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When a samurai meets his ends,\Nhe needs to do the honorable thing.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:43.09,0:13:46.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your guilt is certain and\Nyour crimes were unspeakable.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:47.09,0:13:50.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You are receiving an honorable\Ndeath that you hardly deserve.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:51.10,0:13:53.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take pride in your seppuku.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:10.84,0:14:13.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can still smell the scent of blood.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:16.43,0:14:21.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's from you. You're the slasher!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:29.65,0:14:33.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Zoro grunts]
Dialogue: 50,0:14:35.99,0:14:38.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:14:38.57,0:14:40.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[samurai guards gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:14:48.71,0:14:51.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I had to. Sorry, Kin'emon.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:52.30,0:14:56.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[snoring]
Dialogue: 50,0:15:31.76,0:15:34.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So we made it then. Wano.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:35.14,0:15:36.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:15:51.41,0:15:53.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NWhere is everybody?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:55.00,0:15:56.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lemme think.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:57.54,0:16:00.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What happened to us again? Let's see.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:22.17,0:16:25.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NYou jerk! You better not\Nhave broken our ship!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:26.00,0:16:29.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]\NIt's a giant dog!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:31.89,0:16:34.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, or is it a boar?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:34.76,0:16:37.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Komachiyo growls]
Dialogue: 50,0:16:56.11,0:16:58.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, or is it a boar?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:00.35,0:17:02.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why's that ape have a sword?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:02.52,0:17:05.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I guess this really is\Nthe Land of Wano.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:12.79,0:17:15.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wild sword monkey\Nversus wild dog thing?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:15.87,0:17:18.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano's a pretty crazy place!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:30.01,0:17:31.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[groans]
Dialogue: 50,0:17:32.76,0:17:34.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[roars]
Dialogue: 50,0:17:37.43,0:17:40.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[barks]
Dialogue: 50,0:17:40.14,0:17:44.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Komachiyo, Hihimaru barking]
Dialogue: 50,0:17:45.02,0:17:46.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, you two!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:47.28,0:17:51.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can fight each other all you want,\Njust don't do it near my ship!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:00.02,0:18:03.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's see. What was I doing again?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:07.42,0:18:11.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NWhen we climbed up the waterfall,\Nwe saw land for a split second,
Dialogue: 50,0:18:11.72,0:18:14.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but then we got sucked\Ninto that big whirlpool!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:15.47,0:18:16.97,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:16.97,0:18:19.85,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I think that the tide is\Nrunning in reverse somehow.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:21.30,0:18:23.05,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Just hang in there, Sunny!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:23.05,0:18:25.51,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:18:25.51,0:18:27.85,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Nami. I got you.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:27.85,0:18:29.60,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I appreciate it, Sanji!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:29.60,0:18:32.50,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's my pleasure, I assure you!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:32.50,0:18:33.67,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,[CARROT]\NSanji!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:33.67,0:18:34.84,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Grab onto me!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:35.55,0:18:38.34,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Good! Now, I'm gonna jump us to safety!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:39.76,0:18:40.72,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,You ready?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:40.72,0:18:41.93,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NSanji, wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:41.93,0:18:47.19,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,[sobs]\NYou gotta take me with you!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:47.19,0:18:48.65,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Hang on, Chobro!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:48.65,0:18:50.15,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I got a weight limit here!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:50.15,0:18:53.95,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,C'mon now! You can't leave me behind!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:53.95,0:18:56.08,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,You're on your own for this one, bud.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:57.45,0:19:00.29,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,How could you?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:00.29,0:19:01.50,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm just kidding.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:01.50,0:19:03.21,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I've always got your back, Chopper.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:03.21,0:19:04.54,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER]\NSanji!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:04.96,0:19:09.30,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,[Brook laughs]\NI hope you all\Nsaved room for one more!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:10.02,0:19:13.69,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,[Brook laughs]\NLet's bring it in! Love ya!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:14.49,0:19:17.03,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,No offense, but you're kinda pokey!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:17.03,0:19:19.33,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,You're way too close!\NBrook, stop being gross!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:19.33,0:19:21.31,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHey! Use my belly to bounce.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:21.31,0:19:22.48,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Sound good?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:24.57,0:19:25.69,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a plan!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:27.86,0:19:29.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[all gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:19:30.11,0:19:31.70,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,See you soon, Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:31.70,0:19:34.41,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NYeah! I'll be right behind you guys!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:37.20,0:19:39.54,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Alrighty! You be good, Sunny! Okay?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:40.41,0:19:43.33,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,I promise to come find\Nyou when it's safer!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:48.59,0:19:51.09,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:51.09,0:19:53.91,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,[octopus A grunts]
Dialogue: 50,0:19:53.91,0:19:55.62,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,The octopus?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:56.35,0:19:59.02,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,What do you even want from me? Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:00.65,0:20:04.44,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Stupid octopus!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:12.44,0:20:14.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Komachiyo, Hihimaru grunting]
Dialogue: 50,0:20:18.40,0:20:21.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah. That must be why\NI woke up on this beach.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:22.53,0:20:26.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Am I still above the waterfall?\NOr is this below it?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:26.24,0:20:28.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't tell if this is Wano or not.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:35.33,0:20:37.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Crap! The Vivre Card!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:36.66,0:20:37.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[Luffy groans]
Dialogue: 50,0:20:38.20,0:20:41.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where did it go? Is it in the sea?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:43.26,0:20:45.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:45.80,0:20:47.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Luffy sighs]
Dialogue: 50,0:20:47.71,0:20:49.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NOh, well. Whatever.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:51.16,0:20:55.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OTAMA]\NStop! Lemme go already!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:55.16,0:20:57.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I didn't say nothin' like that!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:57.58,0:20:59.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And gimme back my rice, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:00.38,0:21:02.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BEAST PIRATE WAITER A]\NI know what I heard.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:03.21,0:21:06.31,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,The Kozuki Clan is gonna come back!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:06.31,0:21:08.69,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,And then you'll pay!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:09.00,0:21:10.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BEAST PIRATE WAITER A]\NYou traitor.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:10.84,0:21:14.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've chosen to ally yourself\Nwith a bunch of villains, have you?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:15.14,0:21:17.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's a serious crime\Nand there'll be no mercy!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:17.64,0:21:21.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As punishment, we'll either sell you\Nto a brothel or toss you in jail.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:21.40,0:21:22.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But, mister!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:22.61,0:21:23.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BEAST PIRATE WAITER A]\NAw, shut your trap!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:24.40,0:21:26.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MASSUI]\NEnough. We've got a job to do.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:29.20,0:21:31.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look! There's a ship on the beach!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:31.20,0:21:32.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BEAST PIRATE WAITER A]\NJust one survivor?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:32.87,0:21:35.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MASSUI]\NThe baboon's still\Nbattling the lion-dog?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:35.73,0:21:39.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought he was at least strong\Nenough to take care of that puny thing!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:40.57,0:21:42.11,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[Otama gasps]\NKomachiyo?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:43.82,0:21:45.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[barks]
Dialogue: 50,0:21:45.66,0:21:48.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, guys, knock it off already.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:48.12,0:21:50.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There it is! We found the ship, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:50.70,0:21:52.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Looks like the report was correct.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:52.66,0:21:54.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HAWKINS]\NCan you see its crew?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:54.32,0:21:55.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MASSUI]\NJust one man.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:55.95,0:21:57.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How interesting.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:57.41,0:21:59.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MASSUI]\NWe'll knock him out\Nand bring him back with us!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:59.88,0:22:02.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think he'll make for\Na good laborer, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:06.85,0:22:10.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heheh. That's a good boy,\Njust stay right there.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:11.06,0:22:15.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When you wake up, we'll have a surprise\Nfor you: a lifetime of slavery!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:37.18,0:22:38.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who just attacked me?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:39.26,0:22:40.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BEAST PIRATE WAITER A]\NYou bastard!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:45.47,0:22:46.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:48.14,0:22:50.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HAWKINS]\NHey. What's going on?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:50.02,0:22:53.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BEAST PIRATE WAITER A]\NUh. Nothing, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:54.19,0:22:55.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Luffy grunts]
Dialogue: 50,0:22:55.36,0:22:56.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:22:58.70,0:23:00.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Beast Pirate waiter A groans]
Dialogue: 50,0:23:08.75,0:23:10.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This beach is popular, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:12.41,0:23:15.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn. You stupid baboon!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:15.96,0:23:18.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't just stand there!\NYou gotta do something!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:19.38,0:23:22.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Forget the mutt for now!\NCatch that guy!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:22.47,0:23:25.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[screeches]
Dialogue: 50,0:23:27.47,0:23:29.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BEAST PIRATE WAITER A]\NActually, you know what?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:29.35,0:23:31.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and kill him!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:34.52,0:23:36.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[barks]
Dialogue: 50,0:23:48.49,0:23:50.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[screeching]
Dialogue: 50,0:24:02.63,0:24:04.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you want something?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:32.99,0:24:38.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heh. Good! Now, you two\Nplay nice and get along, okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:39.66,0:24:41.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Beast Pirate waiter A groans]\NWhy the hell are you
Dialogue: 50,0:24:41.96,0:24:43.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,bowing your head like that?
Dialogue: 50,0:24:43.58,0:24:46.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's just one measly pirate, you fool!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:48.55,0:24:50.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[yells]
Dialogue: 50,0:24:50.34,0:24:51.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Beast Pirate waiter A groans]
Dialogue: 50,0:25:00.14,0:25:03.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You miserable brat! I'll make you pay!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:03.85,0:25:05.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Otama screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:25:05.19,0:25:07.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You are gonna die for that one!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:07.02,0:25:08.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:25:08.23,0:25:10.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no use running from me!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:10.53,0:25:12.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry, mister!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:12.49,0:25:14.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Beast Pirate waiter A screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:25:19.94,0:25:23.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OTAMA]\NI surrender! I surrender!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:24.45,0:25:26.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? Weirdo.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:26.99,0:25:31.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OTAMA]\NI said I surrender!\NThis is the surrender pose!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:36.08,0:25:38.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wasn't gonna do\Nanything to you though!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:38.37,0:25:41.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Really? Do you mean it, sir?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:41.71,0:25:42.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:43.29,0:25:48.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, then maybe, if you're not gonna\Nkill me, could I ask for a favor?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:48.17,0:25:49.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,An itty-bitty one?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:49.75,0:25:51.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's my only chance!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:53.05,0:25:55.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NWhat is it? Tell me.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:55.47,0:25:57.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OTAMA]\NAll right. Let's do it.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:57.39,0:25:59.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NHuh? Do what?
Dialogue: 50,0:25:59.02,0:26:01.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Kibi Dan, go!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:04.98,0:26:07.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay! Here you go!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:07.15,0:26:09.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?! You pulled your cheek off!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:14.35,0:26:16.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Take it! This is for you!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:22.07,0:26:23.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Hihimaru roars]
Dialogue: 50,0:26:23.40,0:26:25.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Otama screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:26:25.94,0:26:27.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you even trying to do?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:27.78,0:26:29.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Hihimaru growling]
Dialogue: 50,0:26:30.99,0:26:32.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 50,0:26:42.29,0:26:43.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now shake.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:48.22,0:26:51.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Luffy gasps]\NYou just\Ntamed that huge ape monster!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:51.97,0:26:54.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I did it! I did it!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:54.13,0:26:57.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I finally made pals\Nwith the mountain baboon!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:57.09,0:26:59.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now he'll stop causing trouble for me!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:59.80,0:27:03.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yay! Yay!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:03.10,0:27:05.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're some kinda power-user, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:05.27,0:27:07.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And it looks like it's\Na pretty handy one, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:07.94,0:27:09.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[giggles]
Dialogue: 50,0:27:12.23,0:27:15.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Attaboy! You're our buddy now!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:16.09,0:27:17.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Komachiyo barks]
Dialogue: 50,0:27:17.38,0:27:20.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Otama giggles]\NGood monkey!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:20.83,0:27:22.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NIs that your dog?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:22.63,0:27:25.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[OTAMA]\NYup! His name is Komachiyo!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:27.34,0:27:30.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Komachiyo! I'm Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:30.55,0:27:32.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now let's be friends from here on out!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:34.06,0:27:39.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[Otama giggles]\NOh, by the way,\Nmy name's Otama.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:40.01,0:27:43.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alrighty then, Otama!\NIt's real nice to meetcha!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:43.49,0:27:45.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's nice to meet you, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:45.16,0:27:47.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY]\NOh yeah! I got a quick question.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:47.45,0:27:50.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I need to know if I\Nmade it to Wano or not.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:50.46,0:27:52.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Made it to Wano"?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:53.66,0:27:56.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah! This is the Land of Wano!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:56.45,0:28:00.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And the beach that we're on now\Nis in a region called Kuri!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:00.93,0:28:02.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Got it, Big Bro?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:02.36,0:28:05.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's great! I wasn't sure!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:06.32,0:28:09.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I finally made it to the Land of Wano!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:10.20,0:28:12.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm comin' for you, Kaido!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:12.57,0:28:14.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, "Big Bro"? The heck?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:14.53,0:28:18.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When did I become\Nyour big brother, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:19.04,0:28:21.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A big brother's a big brother.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:21.30,0:28:22.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's that even mean?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:22.96,0:28:24.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever, I guess.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:24.59,0:28:27.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It just makes sense! Big Bro!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:27.22,0:28:29.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TAMA giggles]
Dialogue: 50,0:28:33.12,0:28:36.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The men at Kuri Beach.\NWe lost communication with them.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:36.74,0:28:40.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I speculate that someone\Nmay have taken them down!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:40.00,0:28:42.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HAWKINS PIRATE B]\NWhile there's no trace of a ship,
Dialogue: 50,0:28:43.40,0:28:45.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your thoughts, Boss? What should we do?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:54.66,0:28:57.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't let word get back to Kaido.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:00.75,0:29:02.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[HAWKINS]\NI'll take care of it.
